* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.png binary

# The paths whose changes change no run of Kestrel: the task suite's tool, its baseline, the documentation and Markdown
# files. This is their one definition: a debug build's dirty flag (build-logic's BuildCommitTask) and the commits that
# :tools:eval compares (Resume.kestrelChanges) leave them out through git's pathspec ':(exclude,attr:kestrel-neutral)'.
tools/eval/** kestrel-neutral
eval/baseline.json kestrel-neutral
docs/** kestrel-neutral
*.md kestrel-neutral
